Suggests: python3-certbot-dns-cloudflare, python3-certbot-dns-rfc2136
Description: Cockpit module to manage Let's Encrypt certificates
 Request, renew and delete Let's Encrypt certificates from the Cockpit web
 console using certbot, with HTTP-01 or DNS-01 validation (including
 wildcard certificates through certbot DNS plugins). A certificate can be
 installed as Cockpit's own web server certificate and is redeployed
 automatically after every renewal.
